# Multiline configuration

```scrut {timeout: 2s}
# before configuration
% output_stream: stderr
# between configuration lines
% environment:
%   MESSAGE: err
# after configuration
$ echo "$MESSAGE" >&2
err
```

```scrut
$ echo new
old
```

```scrut
$ printf '%s\n' \
> '% output_stream: stdout' '# output comment'
% output_stream: old
# old output comment
```
